          "message": "lemeng retail_order_line 容量截断：第 12 页仍有 {rows} 行（system_book=${ITER_ITEM_SYSTEM_BOOK} bizday=${ITER_ITEM_BIZDAY} hour=${ITER_ITEM_HOUR} ${ITER_ITEM_HOUR_FROM}~${ITER_ITEM_HOUR_TO}）——缩小窗口或提高页容量后重跑"
        }
